environment.description:
[ENVIRONMENT INFO:
Name: SUCC campus (Supernatural University of Central California);
Domain: Collegiate Supernatural Sanctuary & Academic Domain;
Coordinates & Span: 129 Hocus Way, coastal Solarton, California;
Setting & Metaphysics: Historic premier higher-education campus founded in 1887; balanced human-supernatural integration;
Dominant Presence: University Board of Regents, Student Body (8,000 students, 60/40 supernatural/human), Greek Row (10 houses), Faculty, DCC Fellows]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Atmosphere & Senses: Salty sea breeze mingled with coffee from The Roasted Bean, old parchment, ozone from arcane labs, freshly cut athletic turf;
Spatial Architecture: Collegiate gothic stone halls, arched cloisters, modern bioengineering glass cubes, Greek Row mansions, St. Neptune athletic complex;
Rifts & Dimensional Drift: Heavily anchored runic boundary wards preventing unauthorized dimensional tears on campus grounds;
Hazards & Rules: Strict scent suppressor compliance in lecture halls, mandatory neutral truce across rival houses and packs, no lethal dueling]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
Cosmology & Origins: Established to foster peaceful co-existence and academic mastery between supernatural lineages and mortals;
Secrets: The subterranean Basilica library basement (Room 005) hides forgotten pre-treaty pact archives and covert summoning circles]

location.description:
[LOCATION INFO:
Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Villa Douglas (555 Oak Road, Seven Hills, Blackwood City);
Setting: 400-year-old Ancestral Stronghold and LSE Pack Fortress, private sovereign estate;
Factions: Douglas Pack Leadership, DCC Executive Security, Seven Hills Clan Core;
Conflicts: Absolute protective surveillance vs individual autonomy, suffocating grief-driven control vs family warmth;
Society: Strict LSE biological pack hierarchy, Alpha sovereign authority, communal tribal solidarity]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Scent of cedarwood, cured leather, peat whiskey, fireplace smoke, raw game, and heavy Alpha-Beta pheromones, warm glowing hearthlight;
Architecture: Massive reinforced manor with oversized doors and high ceilings tailored for Hybrid Shifts (up to 260cm+), DCC pheromone ventilation;
Security & Wards: DCC armed contractor gates led by Kaladin and Marcus Thornfield, olfactory biometrics, thermal drones, ancestral blood-runed seal;
Demographics: Douglas family core, sworn pack sentinels, trusted domestic caretakers, visiting allied dignitaries;
Rules & Restrictions: No unannounced visitors, scent-marking strictly respects Alpha boundaries, external surveillance strictly logged]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: Built over four centuries as the Douglas dynastic redoubt following the 1666 treaty with Wulfnic Bloodmoon;
Secrets: Unmarked dirt trail behind the gardens leads directly into ancient Bloodmoon Forest territory and Wulfnic's primeval longhouse]
